 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Contract Accounting – External Tax Audit and Compliance Reporting (2SJ)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio94afdc7b33334455b1f76c9ce320fe54\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio94afdc7b33334455b1f76c9ce320fe54__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item allows internal and external auditors to view, analyze, and extract accounting relevant data from Convergent Contract Accounting (FI-CAC). Accounting data covers the relevant customizing extracts, business partner extracts, and FI-CAC documents. Extracts are exported by the Administrator and are analyzed by the External Auditor. Extracts can also be imported in standard tax auditor software. The three legally required access types (direct system access, indirect system access, and file access) are supported.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio94afdc7b33334455b1f76c9ce320fe54__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create data extracts</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Import data extracts</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Export data extracts</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Overview data extracts</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Delete document extracts</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio94afdc7b33334455b1f76c9ce320fe54__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Analyze FI-CA documents from a tax auditor perspective</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Extract accounting data for standard tax auditor software</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>合同会计核算 - 外部税务审计和合规报告 (2SJ)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio94afdc7b33334455b1f76c9ce320fe54\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio94afdc7b33334455b1f76c9ce320fe54__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目允许内部和外部审计员查看、分析和提取 Convergent Contract Accounting (FI-CAC) 中的会计相关数据。会计数据涵盖相关定制提取、业务伙伴提取和 FI-CAC 凭证。提取由管理员导出并由外部审计员分析。还可在标准税务审计员软件中导入提取。支持三种法律要求的访问类型（直接系统访问、间接系统访问和文件访问）。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio94afdc7b33334455b1f76c9ce320fe54__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建数据提取</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">导入数据摘要</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">导出数据摘要</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">概览数据提取</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">删除凭证摘要</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio94afdc7b33334455b1f76c9ce320fe54__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">从税务审计员角度分析 FI-CA 凭证</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提取标准税务审计员软件的会计数据</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
